Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WHOIS and RDAP server for the dn42 registry
 Serves a local dn42 registry checkout over WHOIS and optionally RDAP.
 Includes systemd socket units; the registry must be supplied separately.
